  "title": {
    "zh": "四闸接力锁",
    "en": "Four-Latch Cascade"
  },
  "concept": {
    "zh": "二进制翻转 · 状态跨闸保留 · 连过四闸",
    "en": "Binary toggles · Carry state forward · Four latches"
  },
  "brief": {
    "zh": "四道闸共用一个开关。扫描里的 initial 是初始状态，blocks 按闸门顺序列出收到的 0、1 信号。信号 1 翻转开关，信号 0 保持原状。每道闸处理完本组信号后，状态 0 开上路，状态 1 开下路。通过该闸后保留开关状态，再处理下一组。每道闸内取一块电池，最后到出口。三张地图均限 28 回合，每次移动和拾取各花 1 回合。",
    "en": "Four latches share one switch. Read its initial state and the blocks of signals, one block for each latch. A 1 flips the switch and a 0 leaves it unchanged. After the current block, state 0 opens the upper route and state 1 opens the lower route. Carry the switch state to the next latch. Collect one battery at each latch and reach the exit. All three maps allow 28 turns, with each move and pickup costing one turn."
  },
